  "_note": "INTERNAL. Double-leaf variant authored from the single-leaf sheet plus standard double-door practice: a fire-rated double door must close its passive leaf before the active leaf, so position 10 is the closing sequence controller (integrated in the operator) and the sensor strips repeat on the passive leaf (5.2). CONFIRM the position numbering and the passive-leaf drive arrangement against the manufacturer's double-leaf reference sheet before first customer issue — this file is drawn to standard practice, not to a sighted reference.",

